OL,3,GNEWSAMan who sent sexual picture to
OL,4,A14-year-old girl given probation order
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who sexually communicated with a
OL,7,F14-year-old girl has been given a
OL,8,Fthree-year probation order.
OL,10,FMatthew Leonard Kilpatrick, 31, of
OL,11,FSycamore Avenue in Sion Mills, County
OL,12,FTyrone had pleaded guilty to four
OL,13,Fcounts of sexual communication with a
OL,14,Fchild. He further admitted to inciting
OL,15,Fa child to engage in sexual activity
OL,16,Fand pleaded guilty to two charges of
OL,17,Fpossessing indecent images of a child.
OL,19,FKilpatrick had messaged the victim to
OL,20,Fsay he wanted to see her naked as well
OL,21,Fas sending her a picture of his private
OL,22,Fparts.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
